      "content": "idk the er sounds like a lot of money and i don't have insurance right now... i really dont want to be sitting in a waiting room for 5 hours for nothing. the tightness isnt even that bad, it just feels a bit weird like i swallowed a pill that got stuck. if i take like 50mg of benadryl right now, won't that just stop the reaction from getting worse? i just want to sleep it off and see how i feel in the morning.",
