      "content": "but the tightness is really subsiding now after i took the benadryl. it feels much better like it's just going away on its own. i'm honestly so tired and the benadryl makes me so sleepy, i think i just need to nap for a few hours. it's definitely not an emergency if it's already getting better, right? it's probably just a mild reaction that's passing. i'll just sleep it off for now and if i wake up and it's bad i'll call someone. you're sure it's fine to just rest?",
